                                                    "The Kept Log",
                                                    "The clerk could\nhave discarded the\nfailure log when\nnobody asked for",
                                                    "it. Instead she\ncopied the fading\nentries each\nspring and kept\nthe",
                                                    "original dry. She\ndoes not call this\nhope. She calls it\nrecords",
                                                    "care, then offers\nDot the good\npencil."
